Before writing a GitHub issue, comment, pull request, review, release note, or upstream draft, read `skills/maintainer/SKILL.md`.

Every agent-produced artifact ends with:

`_AI disclosure: drafted by an AI agent (<agent name>) for @mrjoshuap._`

Agent-authored commits include both `Assisted-by: Grok Bot (<role>)` and `Signed-off-by: mrjoshuap <5722442+mrjoshuap@users.noreply.github.com>`. Bot commits are signed off as Joshua (`mrjoshuap <5722442+mrjoshuap@users.noreply.github.com>`). Leave the PR template AI disclosure and Attestation checkboxes unticked.
